" SCHEDULED / DEADLINE planning lines and reschedule logging.

Given org (first SCHEDULED is inserted without a log note):
  * TODO Task

Execute:
  call SFunc('date', 'set_planning')('SCHEDULED', '<2026-07-15 mié>')

Expect org:
  * TODO Task
    SCHEDULED: <2026-07-15 mié>

Given org (replacing a date logs the old one, Emacs style):
  * TODO Task
    SCHEDULED: <2026-07-09 jue +1w>

Execute:
  call SFunc('date', 'set_planning')('SCHEDULED', '<2026-07-15 mié +1w>')

Then:
  AssertEqual [
        \ '* TODO Task',
        \ '  SCHEDULED: <2026-07-15 mié +1w>',
        \ '  :LOGBOOK:',
        \ '  - Rescheduled from "[2026-07-09 jue +1w]" on ' . Now(),
        \ '  :END:',
        \ ], getline(1, '$')

Given org (DEADLINE goes after an existing SCHEDULED):
  * TODO Task
    SCHEDULED: <2026-07-09 jue>

Execute:
  call SFunc('date', 'set_planning')('DEADLINE', '<2026-07-20 lun>')

Expect org:
  * TODO Task
    SCHEDULED: <2026-07-09 jue>
    DEADLINE: <2026-07-20 lun>
